  "geometryBasis": "The seven native members of the building relation form its exact 32-corner ring. The central four-column porticos occupy the two mapped projections. The open stairs and courtyard approaches extend beyond the portico faces.",
  "sectionBasis": "Two cleared August 2014 photos establish the north portico, stairs, recessed red wall, pale Ionic columns and stepped parapets. The south portico uses its mapped outline and a proportional interpretation. The original unflattened terrain sets local grade.",
